@page
@model PrivacyModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy Policy";
}
<div class="privacy-policy">
<h1>@ViewData["Title"]</h1>

<p><em>Last updated: August 2026</em></p>

<p>At auth.minecolonies.com, we keep things as simple and transparent as possible. We respect your privacy and collect only the absolute minimum information required to operate our service.</p>

<h2>Information We Collect</h2>
<p><strong>Account Identifiers:</strong> When you authenticate with us (e.g., via Discord, Patreon, or Minecraft/Pex), we receive basic public profile information and unique IDs to verify your identity and support status.</p>

<h2>How We Use Your Data</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Reward Unlocks:</strong> We use your account details solely to check your eligible support tiers and unlock your earned in-game or community rewards within MineColonies.</li>
    <li><strong>Essential Functionality:</strong> Maintaining your active login session while you use the authentication portal.</li>
</ul>

<h2>What We Don't Do</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>No Data Selling:</strong> We do not sell, rent, trade, or share your personal data with third parties or advertisers under any circumstances.</li>
    <li><strong>No Tracking or Profiling:</strong> We do not track your activity across other websites, compile behavioral profiles, or use third-party advertising cookies or analytics trackers.</li>
    <li><strong>No Surplus Usage:</strong> Your data is strictly used for reward verification and account management—nothing else.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Data Retention</h2>
<p>We only store your authorization tokens and associated platform IDs for as long as necessary to maintain your linked account status and grant your rewards.</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you have any questions regarding this policy or your account data, please reach out to the MineColonies team via our official Discord server or community channels.</p>
</div>